From: SJ Park <sj@kernel.org>
Date: Sat, 1 Aug 2026 13:26:32 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] samples/damon/mtier: error out for zero quota goal target
 values

This issue was discovered [1] by Sashiko.

[1] https://lore.kernel.org/20260801202657.117135-1-sj@kernel.org

Signed-off-by: SJ Park <sj@kernel.org>
---
 samples/damon/mtier.c | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/samples/damon/mtier.c b/samples/damon/mtier.c
index 27dc88bdf7a0e..bea45c87cc9be 100644
--- a/samples/damon/mtier.c
+++ b/samples/damon/mtier.c
@@ -161,6 +161,9 @@ static struct damon_ctx *damon_sample_mtier_build_ctx(bool promote)
 	if (!scheme)
 		goto free_out;
 	damon_set_schemes(ctx, &scheme, 1);
+	/* zero target value causes division by zero in damos_quota_store() */
+	if (!node0_mem_used_bp || !node0_mem_free_bp)
+		goto free_out;
 	quota_goal = damos_new_quota_goal(
 			promote ? DAMOS_QUOTA_NODE_MEM_USED_BP :
 			DAMOS_QUOTA_NODE_MEM_FREE_BP,
-- 
2.47.3

